    "ciphertext": "~022079344986866694907",
    "title": "<span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> CRO Expert — Full Theme Redesign for High-SKU Store (Goal: 2% CVR)",
    "description": "We're Feel Ink (https://feel.ink/), a fast-growing ecommerce brand selling semi-permanent jagua tattoos. Our store runs on <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> with a large catalog (many SKUs). We're at a critical growth stage and ready to rebuild everything — the interface, the UX, the entire approach — around one goal: conversion.\n\nWhat we need A senior <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> CRO specialist to fully redesign our theme and rebuild the storefront to be 100% optimized for sales. We currently want to go from our current conversion rate to a solid 1–2% CVR.\n\nScope of work\n\nFull theme redesign (we're open to changing everything — layout, navigation, visual identity, structure)\nOptimized architecture for a high-SKU catalog — fast, intuitive browsing and filtering\nBlazing-fast performance (Core Web Vitals, mobile-first, sub-2s load)\nA smart, frictionless cart experience: dynamic cart, upsells/cross-sells, quantity/bundle incentives, free-shipping progress bar, \"you might also need\" logic\nConversion incentives throughout the funnel (urgency, social proof, trust badges, reviews)\nStreamlined PDP and checkout flow to minimize drop-off\nMobile-first design (most of our traffic is mobile)\n\nDeliverables\n\nCRO audit of the current store with prioritized recommendations\nNew design (Figma or prototype) approved before build\nFully built, responsive, fast <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> theme\nA/B testing plan and setup\nHandoff documentation\n\nReferences we like (competitors / inspiration)\n\nhttps://inkster.eu/\nhttps://ezink.co/\n\nWhat to include in your proposal\n\nExamples of <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span> stores you've redesigned + before/after conversion results\nYour approach to CRO for a high-SKU store\nEstimated timeline and total budget for a full theme redesign\nTools you use (theme framework, apps, testing)\n\nWe're ready to move fast. Tell us how you'd take us to a 1–2% conversion rate and what it costs.",
